From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:36:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] device: add the sleep screen setting to the E-Ink app
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

E-Ink settings -> Advanced -> Sleep screen stores Settings.Secure
hibreak_sleep_screen_mode, read by SystemUI when the screen turns off.
The only choice is "Picture · Logo and lock time" (picture, the
default; unknown values show it too). clock_1, clock_5 and clock_15 are
reserved for a later clock mode and not offered. Replaces the unused
strings of the retired sleep screen options.

Adds Clock (updates every minute / 5 / 15 minutes: clock_1, clock_5, clock_15), Lock screen (lockscreen) and Custom image (custom) to the single-choice list, with a battery note. Custom image is picked with ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT, fitted to the display and stored as PNG in the app's device-protected storage (token hibreak_sleep_screen_image); SleepScreenImageProvider serves it read-only to SystemUI (read/write permission STATUS_BAR_SERVICE). "Show lock time" toggle (hibreak_sleep_screen_image_time, default on). English and zh-CN strings.
